     1	//! Sessions panel — grouped by project, worktrees, with collapsible sections.
     2	//!
     3	//! Sessions are grouped under their owning project: authoritatively via the
     4	//! daemon's `owning_project` when it serves that field (exact-root matches
     5	//! today), else by matching the session's workspace root against the project
     6	//! catalogue (`daemon.projects`) — exact root first, then component-boundary
     7	//! prefix against each project's root and registered worktree paths (longest
     8	//! root wins). Sessions with no matching project fall into an "Other" bucket.
     9	//!
    10	//! Within a project, sessions whose workspace root sits under one of the
    11	//! project's registered worktrees (daemon-enriched `worktrees` on
    12	//! `ProjectInfo`, component-boundary prefix match) group under that worktree
    13	//! sub-row; the rest stay in the project's flat list.
    14	//!
    15	//! Every session returned by the daemon is shown, including zero-turn drafts,
    16	//! matching the TUI's persisted-session discovery.
